787660177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHART YOUR OWN COURSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crew needs a home and your boat is yours. Each run starts fresh with a new ship.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing harder expeditions unlocks new starting vessel, each with their own strengths, weaknesses, and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression for your crew that carries between runs. Each attempt at making it out of the cursed waters alive is truly a unique experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4715980/extras/1aefdb4971e67bae179362a8f5bddbb1.poster.avif?t=1787660177\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4715980/extras/1aefdb4971e67bae179362a8f5bddbb1.webm?t=1787660177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4715980/extras/1aefdb4971e67bae179362a8f5bddbb1.mp4?t=1787660177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Gather your crew and set off through hostile waters in this terrifying co-op survival game for up to 4 players. Scavenge for fuel, gear, and scrap while nameless horrors rise from beneath the waves to deny your escape.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4715980/61900b1d83660bc65290bd816be6d86219ad3bd2/header.jpg?t=1787660177", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4715980/7df1c0dd06c023ede3dd6071506a3a32401c5e16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787660177", "capsule